prompt1:
I have a Lab 11 website with index.html and style.css (pasted below). The theme is [product launch page]. I need to grow it into a website of at least 3 pages, keeping the same theme, colour scheme and fonts. Suggest suitable pages for this theme, and briefly say what each page should contain. The home page must stay as index.html.
prompt2:
make three seperate pages on a single tab. make sure i am not redirected for these pages
prompt3:
